#: scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec14682860f844950e8dd390290dd55ce49c17f8d0e0a05776651bb1e653b2ba
#. default-sha256: 0bcbdbd44a01fb90f26822f25799bfe63184398cfec8d4b800bd888d29ef3f13
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Come over here, "
"Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Vieni qui, "
"Giselle."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e21bf7ce6ad6af24220e81b4fc5c1270fd40e54105c5b236e4db938d6b157548
#. default-sha256: d023a7c13e47ffcb0142d373d1d01fec870bfda9f127c1907dad948cfd56da0a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫O... ⟪k:1⟫Okay... ⟪k:2⟫Um, ⟪k:3⟫may I ask why you asked me here so late at night, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Va... ⟪k:1⟫Va bene... ⟪k:2⟫Ehm, ⟪k:3⟫posso chiederle come mai mi ha chiamata⟪k:4⟫a quest’ora "
"della notte, Padrone?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b7c8c54573c6f5a5a3fde7ab811c079f06514917f06fa0511812434e2b966f6
#. default-sha256: f412d275c7873744ac192ae3590b6b45459924126c367e17763c61c56f32bbc9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, I just wanted to have a little chat.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Care for some wine? ⟪k:3⟫Come closer, and "
"I’ll pour you a glass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, volevo soltanto fare quattro chiacchiere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Gradisci un po’ di vino? ⟪k:3⟫"
"Avvicinati, te ne verso un calice."

#: scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f67fb5a370da84d138b5fbb8a12ed0341f83d6d6a6decbadd0baca41a8abc700
#. default-sha256: 991b618c64db455c6e2db9fb07a4923a76b7475c53b07911e3f02f9a2955200d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had this wine imported from up north.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They use very hard water, and like it "
"rather tart,⟪k:3⟫so it leaves quite the lasting impression on your tongue."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Questo vino è importato dal nord.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Utilizzano un’acqua molto dura che gli conferisce "
"una certa acidità,⟪k:3⟫perciò lascia un retrogusto duraturo sulla lingua."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a657f3698cd007f4ee84f55c1e2f4e12c11078ac41282899e965b56976a775f
#. default-sha256: 2a2c8da48a1d02e1e15f5262aaabc7b979f637bfe5322354192a36c924832eb2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And yet, it goes down so easily, you just can’t seem to stop.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What do you say? Have "
"a sip."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eppure, va giù così facilmente che non riesci proprio a fermarti.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Che ne dici? "
"Bevine un sorso."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9dc13d269f1ea563ccda33ae600f20a2801e0fc3599c753e29bdb3782b2c1c11
#. default-sha256: 93c6a38ea022d561f3b1a986313bfc6fdb0a328ea679497b103a2ae98d0496d9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or does your expertise as a trader allow you to evaluate a wine’s quality without tasting it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oppure la tua esperienza da commerciante ti permette di valutare⟪k:1⟫la qualità di un vino "
"senza aver bisogno di assaggiarlo?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b62932ff072899aa53aa54106b53bb0218aaffc930d71b4f4eaafab983131ca3
#. default-sha256: 3bad87fcdf5855d71a9437b9b93470ac53542321dc9aa7988a4f909ed64c8d12
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫but... ⟪k:3⟫um..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫però... ⟪k:3⟫mmh..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 636eaf4ea8128e47bbd03133a3282f0dcb527696c4f213e178e63a88e49da56c
#. default-sha256: 2b20ffaa84beb1023817431adbe04714f61c9ae6bc0ea1856a4dd610fb0c4805
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, Giselle, don’t trample all over my good graces."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Giselle, ti prego, non rifiutare la mia cortesia."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13e05e08a09ca46844dfb24e7ad00443e64bf9082ca031895375fbe7d3ac2625
#. default-sha256: 1938932de9044100e92c72e34df55472212418f12a05f299683b6557e5073860
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Very well then... ⟪k:1⟫I will have a sip, Master, but no more..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Va bene allora... ⟪k:1⟫Berrò un sorso, Padrone, ma non di più..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 222d7e08022479f93318170eac73718c5ab8b36790916f3f3b8a39021dad004c
#. default-sha256: 58f13b259d8c1203744825904eaff083d117a2bf5d760a29f299dfb254cc5e4e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Have you ever considered growing out your hair?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hai mai pensato di farti crescere i capelli?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 242eab37cb2872a022667b190af6239a096ece817e497739bb276b3bb774db4c
#. default-sha256: 9f252f0e4e851282822a59411ee444918bd13e72193e67e03a940d5b8fc261f7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Having long hair made it difficult to do my job..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Avere i capelli lunghi rende difficile svolgere il mio lavoro..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 913a879e1258fdc96d40aff7b6fd4545742ea0f81e77e8309680923b355e4d88
#. default-sha256: e2441a8457d6adf5619c45ddaf6d212a0826caa382f08eaf52a4e4c0b11ee458
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not a merchant anymore, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You deserve to look like the woman you truly "
"are."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Però non sei più una mercante.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Meriti di apparire come la donna che sei veramente."

#: scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54fdf4d6870bf5c4b9793a83e06fe274811ff93ae745634bf78dd907f3ea81df
#. default-sha256: e47180471c0a3a2c2d909f6b0e41aa153ba120508eb9438dc8639dda9dee3878
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I have no doubt longer hair would accentuate your natural beauty.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a gorgeous "
"shade of black, so deep a man could get lost in it for years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ho dubbi sul fatto che i capelli lunghi metterebbero in risalto la tua naturale bellezza."
"⟪k:1⟫ ⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ una splendida sfumatura di nero, così scuro che un uomo potrebbe perdercisi per "
"anni."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4311a5e5520ad3334195ab1cc1189185577b556a6fdff353c2c3c48f5d4d9b85
#. default-sha256: a5c2fcb7aa155243c5f692cb28678fe3dc5c578ddb92406c92e13954531ea2a9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would contrast the color of your skin fabulously.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Highlight your eyes, your "
"cheekbones, your nape, your shoulders, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and your chest..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Creerebbero un magnifico contrasto con il colore della tua pelle.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Esalterebbe i "
"tuoi occhi, i tuoi zigomi, il tuo collo, le tue spalle,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫e il tuo seno..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bf28f66f187307f60be0254ecc597adffec4339123de50970af942296d375d0
#. default-sha256: c06704f5c252299978e335dfd5e057373494254ed1447055185cc78367e18657
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Um, I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I should get going..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ecco, io...⟪k:1⟫ d-⟪k:2⟫dovrei andare..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09f0861e397ffa86599b9d8c4ff257f405a1d0ac606b0bea98af4bac2ad23889
#. default-sha256: 65be9b307139c2a85d52c4ee375af13daa85b04b19382cb3fdad65068b2ed7c6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, but we’re not done talking yet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oh, ma non abbiamo ancora finito di parlare."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60103adfab6116d99b818401453f70beafeaceb70b9040583b22e6db078480ff
#. default-sha256: d77ecc0d9659b1c4f0ffa9fd3dbf34647524648367b6c2bca9f1042a25e44703
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫I would not want a lack of sleep to interfere with my ability to work tomorrow. "
"⟪k:2⟫Thank you very much for the wine. It was delicio—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non... ⟪k:1⟫Non vorrei che la mancanza di sonno interferisse con la mia capacità di lavorare "
"domani. ⟪k:2⟫Molte grazie per il vino. Era delizio—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5704f3552f9cc95cf9fa7203bd8ed9dc71ffc319b2942b7b9d7118e5a26d8590
#. default-sha256: d0a3352b4c1ac39e944cbba3bae8b7b50614717262b6f3b58eab5a99816b7be0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫—?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫—?!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ab0536969bb4ecd16c7eb097d5fdafb49e469cb858d3b1d3a897a80fb3492bb
#. default-sha256: 06dabd4663f234c09f5f933e607fa1b6e8bb266c9d7fd99e4245ab11187dd04c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so cold-hearted, now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From the moment I first laid eyes on you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Su, non c’è bisogno di essere così crudele.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dal primo momento in cui ho messo gli "
"occhi su di te..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ed5281fb8735b90fdebcdc8f37d573a96222d2314e8ca6fa7eda81701ff2898
#. default-sha256: 8837980951d4e813ed31179b018b2e0609214379e2f69a3915053093282c2d21
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫M— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That’s enough fooling around for one night!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫P— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Padrone!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫B-⟪k:5⟫Basta scherzare per questa notte!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f6e1b161989ef425e305cb335316d0a2d0ea28b1405dbddbb07c07d7513ccec
#. default-sha256: 40f9959054698b104fc19666a2b3fe80c1f4f3668144d4306a1bc537be734a43
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, now, don’t be afraid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wouldn’t do anything to hurt you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I simply "
"want to express my love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Suvvia, dai, non aver paura.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non mi permetterei mai di farti del male.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Voglio solo esprimerti il mio amore."

#: scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 797a58aea0f6193de35b4ecb2ece49c42700aad4b35c86b8ebbf008c3b3e59bc
#. default-sha256: 542cd39912f18b16af2de03ca3fcb0ab0576398fee747bc89d408609b082290b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫L— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Let go of me!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I-I only came here to work, nothing more!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫M— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mi lasci!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫S-⟪k:5⟫Sono venuta qui solo per lavorare, e per nient’altro!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57010e1d28d9e5652863d9b3a6abf34bdcf943d1f4ed4aab8a1a4222b3649d7c
#. default-sha256: 49a5fd7dee7636ea7d9223ee6e3d7823467203b73ea8794cc4958fcde6448d91
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The first time I saw you, I thought it would be a tragic waste to leave you to wither away "
"working at some little street-side shop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La prima volta che ti ho vista, ho pensato che sarebbe stato uno spreco lasciarti appassire "
"in un negozietto al lato della strada."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F3005EFA_444A_4354_A225_921F01A37502
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 339b19ef133def49e6cb72e77260220c2d9b73c2ff8240a9ef83d08e1352f1e4
#. default-sha256: f49928634c5c4a1f17cbd0bd06700d1a23de30b84ecc524209928f6da0ddb0be
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F3005EFA_444A_4354_A225_921F01A37502"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Stop—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Si fermi!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_46E28852_C5E3_4052_B683_A1257437AB7D
