msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I was in his presence, I tried to convince myself I was merely an object.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I "
"had no emotions, so he couldn’t hurt me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando ero in presenza di quel vecchio, cercavo di convincermi di essere solamente un "
"oggetto.⟪k:1⟫ Non avevo emozioni, perciò non poteva farmi del male."

