#: scenario5:scenario5_7CAECF07_8336_4ED7_B3F0_227FF0ADDFB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d7d8332eaacfbe2e06fbf00b58d588b32f7209234c5b74a0af6eba9525a0673
