msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EB611ACB_B35D_4124_8B3B_C13FE06A9AA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her skin dry, her eyes sunken, her hair faded and stripped of its luster, her head down, her "
"cracked lips barely moving as she spoke."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva la pelle secca, gli occhi infossati, i capelli sbiaditi e spogliati della loro "
"lucentezza, la testa china, e labbra screpolate che a malapena si muovevano mentre parlava."

#: scenario5:scenario5_126DFA18_91A2_4506_8DF7_0D01694C541B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6f8e836d7a2beed1ec77561d9a0dd20843a0a90b464546d81570269ae68b540
