msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You seduced my husband...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aah... ⟪k:3⟫You... ⟪k:4⟫You devil! ⟪k:5⟫You conniving "
"witch!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hai sedotto mio marito...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aah... ⟪k:3⟫Tu... ⟪k:4⟫Sei il diavolo! ⟪k:5⟫Sei un’infida "
"strega!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8451A11D_32BC_4B7A_A939_3BE900DC33DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
