msgid "⟪k:0⟫You don’t get it, do you?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You don’t realize how grievous your sin is, do you?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non lo capisci, eh?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non ti è chiaro quanto atroci siano i tuoi peccati?!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E947BA84_C46C_4057_B2BA_457FAECD73E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63a6fe5208860c3c0d1bd5ee13bc8a41209375b19b3952289e8ee47cb66fb1e6
