msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Someone! Anyone! Restrain this girl! She’s a demon!⟪k:1⟫A devil! Tie her up and hand her "
"over to the clergy!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Qualcuno! Chiunque! Fermi quella donna! ⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ un demonio!⟪k:3⟫Un diavolo! Legatela e "
"consegnatela al clero!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0DB1E3A0_48EF_49AE_80A0_7CE8AFFC26C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84895355038fdeabd9af4c01d35119bed3e6b4e7d3b7ab558e59f8d588dd2c46
