msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, ⟪k:1⟫ahh, ⟪k:2⟫no, that won’t be enough!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A witch, you have to burn her bones, "
"scatter the ashes,⟪k:5⟫or she’ll just come back to life!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, ⟪k:1⟫ahh, ⟪k:2⟫no, non è abbastanza!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫È⟪k:6⟫ una strega; dovete bruciare "
"le sue ossa e disperdere le sue ceneri,⟪k:7⟫altrimenti tornerà in vita!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0797662E_7643_4504_B4E0_344CDF932CAF
