#: scenario5:scenario5_5132C9B2_57DA_4CEE_A66C_BE0C8023194D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6ea3163d90fd0d1d4fcbacdc8189c52cc84492df5a1559381894da873fcf518
