"⟪k:0⟫(If there was no way around it...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫then I should have just done it myself, after the "
"first time...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Se doveva accadere in ogni caso...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫allora avrei dovuto porre io fine a tutto, sin "
"dall’inizio...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_63A15CF7_EE9F_4339_9C89_DEEEC5DFA45F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
