msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I didn’t have the energy to argue with her, or to cry, or to shout."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non avevo le energie per discutere con lei,⟪k:2⟫né tantomeno per piangere, o urlare."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7927DA29_EC30_4681_ABB9_446DBF2E267B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20b0e47e098a5fd2b97f4cc90ebab2599d3e428af36aa86ebbebd13dabbe9079
