msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7927DA29_EC30_4681_ABB9_446DBF2E267B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Before long, a crowd began to form around me and the sobbing mistress—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and in it "
"stood him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ben presto, iniziò a radunarsi una folla attorno a me e alla padrona singhiozzante—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"e in mezzo a quella gente c’era lui."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6D36D0F3_1DEF_4CCA_9866_5579CD4F894E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9305879336479d2cd00a53e9f8b0c51cacad4465d44bed7018063d3e319a0c5
