msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F8429FFA_4F5E_4833_B615_7CA650327914"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but much to my surprise, he stepped in—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫with an embarrassed look on his face—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫to try to settle his wife down and convince her not to have me executed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ma con mia grande sorpresa, si fece avanti—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫con uno sguardo imbarazzato sul volto—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫per cercare di calmare sua moglie⟪k:5⟫e convincerla a non farmi giustiziare."

#: scenario5:scenario5_17C90978_B4B2_41B0_B539_410389F7F10F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4204acc926729954026f18d1e9475d756a04e01c563d83d5e452e7dabe8219c0
