msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17C90978_B4B2_41B0_B539_410389F7F10F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maybe he ⟪k:1⟫did⟪k:2⟫ have a heart after all.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Or maybe he just wanted to save face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Forse ⟪k:1⟫aveva⟪k:2⟫ un cuore.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫O forse voleva solo salvarsi la faccia."

